content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person seeking insurance services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Personal Information"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Quote Request",
      "description": "Customer request for estimated policy pricing.",
      "attributes": [
        "Insurance Policy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Insurance Policy",
      "description": "Formal insurance contract defining coverage.",
      "attributes": [
        "Policy Terms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Policy Terms",
      "description": "Specific conditions and limits of an insurance policy."
    },
    {
      "name": "Personal Information",
      "description": "Customer data required to prepare insurance offers."
    },
    {
      "name": "Insurance Agent",
      "description": "Representative preparing quotes and agreements."
    },
    {
      "name": "Policy Agreement",
      "description": "Final policy document ready for activation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Underwriter",
      "description": "Specialist assessing risk and adjusting policy terms."
    },
    {
      "name": "Claims Adjuster",
      "description": "Employee reviewing claims and approving payouts."
    },
    {
      "name": "Damage Report",
      "description": "Customer-provided description of an incident.",
      "attributes": [
        "Claim"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Claim",
      "description": "Formal request for insurance compensation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Claims Review",
      "description": "Assessment of the validity of a claim."
    },
    {
      "name": "Payout",
      "description": "Approved financial compensation for a claim."
    },
    {
      "name": "Risk Guidelines",
      "description": "Internal rules defining acceptable risk thresholds."
    },
    {
      "name": "Risk Assessment",
      "description": "Evaluation of a policy’s risk level."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Quotes": {
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Personal Information",
        "Insurance Agent",
        "Quote Request",
        "Insurance Policy",
        "Policy Terms",
        "Policy Agreement"
      ]
    },
    "Risk Assessment": {
      "objects": [
        "Underwriter",
        "Risk Assessment",
        "Risk Guidelines"
      ]
    },
    "Claims": {
      "objects": [
        "Claims Adjuster",
        "Damage Report",
        "Claim",
        "Claims Review",
        "Payout"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Risk Assessment--Claims",
      "Risk Assessment--Quotes"
    ]
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
